te\">2026 서울아트마켓 등록안내</h2>\n    <div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">\n      <table class=\"w-full min-w-[760px] text-center text-xs sm:text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead class=\"bg-[#f6f6f6] dark:bg-slate-800 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">\n          <tr>\n            <th colspan=\"3\" class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">구분</th>\n            <th class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">등록기간</th>\n            <th class=\"py-3 px-3 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">할인율</th>\n            <th class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">가격</th>\n            <th class=\"py-3 px-4\">등록방법</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-200 dark:divide-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900\">\n          <tr>\n            <td rowspan=\"8\" class=\"py-3 px-3 font-bold border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/30\">개인등록</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-3 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">사전등록(1차)</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-3 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">전일권</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">8월 12일(수)~9월 15일(화)</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-3 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 font-bold text-indigo-600\">50%</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 font-bold\">50,000원</td>\n            <td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"py-3 px-4 text-xs font-semibold\">온라인 (공식홈페이지)</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-3 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">사전등록(2차)</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-3 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">전일권</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">9월 16일(수)~10월 7일(수)</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-3 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 font-bold text-indigo-600\">30%</td>\n            <td class=\"py-3 px-4 border-r border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 font-bold\">70,000원</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"space-y-1 text-xs text-slate-500 pt-2\">\n      <p>* 중복할인 불가하며 학생은 중‧고‧대학생‧대학원생 포함</p>\n      <p>* 등록기간 및 권종, 가격 등은 사업 추진 현황에 따라 변동될 수 있음</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
