    "fullHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <title>서울아트마켓 등록안내 & 혜택 가이드</title>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0F172A] p-4 sm:p-8 flex justify-center items-center min-h-screen font-sans antialiased\">\n  <div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl bg-white dark:bg-[#1A222C] p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-[32px] border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-6\">\n    <!-- Top Benefit Card -->\n    <div class=\"bg-[#f6f6f6] dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-col gap-5\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">\n        2026 서울아트마켓 개인등록 혜택\n      </h3>\n      <div class=\"border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 pt-5 flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">1</span>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\">모든 PAMS 프로그램 참여 가능</p>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">* 단, 일부 프로그램의 경우 선착순 또는 사전예약으로 입장이 제한될 수 있음</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">2</span>\n          <p class=\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\">2026 서울아트마켓 참가자(델리게이트) 정보 제공</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">3</span>\n          